  "priorExpiration": "2022-09-27",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1927.03 Release of a Security Interest. A proper release of a security interest shall be executed as follows:\n\n(a) As provided on the face of the title, by furnishing:\n\n(1) Firm's name; and\n\n(2) Signature of the authorized agent and date signed;\n\n(b) Through a similar official form of release of security interest from another state; or\n\n(c) Through a release of lien or other encumbrances, form TDMV 20A, “Release of Lien or Other Encumbrances”, (rev. 03/23).\n\nSource. #4823, eff 6-1-90; ss by #4981, eff 11-16-90; ss by #6293, eff 7-23-96; ss by #8123, INTERIM, eff 7-17-04, EXPIRED: 1-13-05\n\nNew. #8339, eff 4-26-05; ss by #10190, eff 9-27-12, EXPIRED: 9-27-22\n\nNew. #13614, eff 4-25-23",
